   "key": "def Index._refresh_files",
   "hash": "c726d7d14191b6f6",
   "does": "For each changed or removed file: parses the new version (inventory; swift_file for Swift), notes which names and types resolution elsewhere depends on changed (a unit added, removed, or with a different name, kind, type or parameters; a stored-closure name; a type whose conformances changed), and replaces the file's rows (files, units with a file node, reference keys, its Swift edges). Then re-resolves the changed Swift files, every Swift file whose references name an affected name or type, and, when conformances changed, every file with units of a type whose family reaches a changed type before or after; rebuilds protocol-requirement edges when any Swift file changed, and build wiring when any script, Makefile or workflow changed.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "scripts/codemap/inventory.py::def inventory",
    "scripts/codemap/graph.py::def swift_file",
    "scripts/codemap/graph.py::def short",
